title: "Deep Learning-based Grading of Cell Nuclei in Histopathological Image Data"
abstract: "Three-stage pipeline for WHO/ISUP grading of clear cell renal cell carcinoma from H&E stained whole slide images, covering nuclei segmentation and grading, classifier-driven autoencoder representation learning, and Vision Transformer whole-patch grading."
